  "body": "When making a notification test, the notification is issued by the client side. It would make sense to have it issued by the homeserver side in order to be closer to the real notification process.\r\nThat might be made by adding to the client-server-api for push notif (https://spec.matrix.org/v1.9/client-server-api/#client-behaviour-11) the endpoint `POST /_matrix/client/v3/pushers/test` with the request body containing `app_id`.",
